ll,["zh-Hant"],[["濃郁系豚骨拉麵排隊名店之一，疫情前餐期往往大排長龍一位難求，疫情間停業整修拿掉了一些品項，目前有5~6種濃厚豚骨和豬背脂油為主的口味可以選擇，還有歷久不衰的「京都風醬油拉麵」也是深受常客喜愛！\n這次平日中午來不用排隊，店內外國人和日本人不少，直接店內點餐機點餐，只收現金(可1000元)，點完要把單子交給店員並帶位，服務人員耐心解說，還溫馨提醒掛鉤位置，十分細心！\n印象中對疫情前お帰り 1.0的印象就是湯頭非常濃郁，這次點限量的黑蒜油豚骨拉麵(340元)印象也一樣，選了麵硬，不愧是老牌名店，麵、湯、肉的水準都很不錯，雖加了豬背脂，但湯頭完全無油膩感，黑蒜油的表現比勝王好，黑蒜搭配湯底的蒜末口感極好，香濃美味，愛死這個湯頭了❤\n兩種叉燒也很有水準，給得多又好吃，肥瘦平衡。麵硬少了點Q彈感，不過口感也是不錯，整體真的好吃！",null,[0,96]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4427249092490370433/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHYldSV1RsRlJlbEl5WkZWMFdrMUhlRkJWYmtKVFdrVnJNMDlWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,27375,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGbWRWTlFRelIyZFV0Wk1HeFBVbkJTWkVrM09VRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd211ac90bd4e3883!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFmdVNQQzR2dUtZMGxPUnBSZEk3OUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGbWRWTlFRelIyZFV0Wk1HeFBVbkJTWkVrM09VRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003d